            "textentryhtml":"<p>\n\tBy June 29, 1966, Gillett G. Griffin (1928-2016), Princeton, NJ [1]; 1999, gift of Gillett G. Griffin to the Princeton University Art Museum.\n</p>\n<p>\n\tNotes:\n\t<br />\n\t[1] First lent to Princeton University Art Museum June 29, 1966 (L.1966.184).\n</p>",
            "remarks":null
